{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36281","headline":"朱秀才庭际蔷薇 · 方干","name":"朱秀才庭际蔷薇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绣难相似画难真，明媚鲜妍绝比伦。\n露压盘条方到地，风吹艳色欲烧春。\n断霞转影侵西壁，浓麝分香入四邻。\n看取後时归故里，庭花应让锦衣新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}